Well, isn't that, uh...

67
00:08:38,504 --> 00:08:42,224
- Well, it's so....
- Why, it's, it's just so...

68
00:08:42,304 --> 00:08:44,784
It's freaky-lookin', okay?
That's what it is.

69
00:08:44,824 --> 00:08:47,064
- Terkina!
- Well, it is!

70
00:08:47,144 --> 00:08:49,064
I mean,
what the heck is it anyway?

71
00:08:49,144 --> 00:08:50,824
[chuckles] He's a baby.

72
00:08:50,944 --> 00:08:52,744
Well... ah!

73
00:08:52,824 --> 00:08:54,624
I can't...

74
