So, where's his mama?

75
00:08:59,264 --> 00:09:02,304
Well, I'm going
to be his mother now.

76
00:09:02,344 --> 00:09:04,424
[baby cooing]

77
00:09:07,144 --> 00:09:11,144
You know, he's not so bad,
once you get used to him.

78
00:09:11,984 --> 00:09:14,984
Kala's gonna be
its mother now.

79
00:09:15,024 --> 00:09:17,104
[grunts]

80
