Kerchak,
I saved him from Sabor.

81
00:09:25,824 --> 00:09:29,144
Kala, it won't
replace the one we lost.

82
00:09:29,184 --> 00:09:33,184
I know that.
But he needs me.

83
00:09:33,224 --> 00:09:36,744
[grunts] But it, it...

84
00:09:36,864 --> 00:09:40,344
Kala, look at it.
It's not our kind.

85
00:09:40,424 --> 00:09:44,304
[sighs] No, you have
to take it back.

86
00:09:44,344 --> 00:09:47,184
Take him back?
But he'll die.

87
00:09:47,264 --> 00:09:49,544
- If the jungle wants him...
- I want him.

88
00:09:49,584 --> 00:09:51,864
Kala, I cannot let you
put our family in danger.

89
00:09:51,944 --> 00:09:53,184
Does he look dangerous to you?

90
00:09:53,304 --> 00:09:54,704
[roars]

91
00:09:55,984 --> 00:09:58,704
[crying]

92
00:10:04,144 --> 00:10:05,584
Was it alone?

93
00:10:05,664 --> 00:10:08,104
Yes. Sabor killed his family.

94
00:10:08,184 --> 00:10:12,264
- Are you sure?
- Yes. There are no others.

95
00:10:13,184 --> 00:10:16,584
[sighs] Then you may keep him.

96
00:10:18,224 --> 00:10:20,384
Kerchak,
I know he'll be a good son.

97
00:10:20,424 --> 00:10:22,224
[Kerchak]
I said he could stay.

98
00:10:22,264 --> 00:10:25,144
That doesn't make him my son.

99
00:10:27,784 --> 00:10:29,984
We will nest here
for the night.

100
00:10:35,584 --> 00:10:38,104
So, what you gonna call it?

101
00:10:38,184 --> 00:10:40,704
I'm gonna call him...

102
00:10:40,744 --> 00:10:42,064
...Tarzan.

103
00:10:42,104 --> 00:10:45,344
Tarzan? Okay, he's your baby.

104
00:10:45,424 --> 00:10:48,584
All right, little lady,
come on. It's way past
your nest time.

105
00:10:48,664 --> 00:10:50,144
- Oh, Mom.
- No.

106
00:10:50,224 --> 00:10:53,184
[Terk] Five more minutes?
Two more minutes?

107
00:10:53,264 --> 00:10:55,224
One more minutes?

108
00:10:58,744 --> 00:11:00,104
- [gasps]
- [crying]

109
00:11:00,144 --> 00:11:03,624
[Kala] Oh! Oh, no.
Shh. Shh.

110
00:11:03,704 --> 00:11:08,104
Don't cry. I'm here.
Come on. Come on.

111
