115
00:11:23,304 --> 00:11:28,464
♪ I will be here
Don't you cry ♪

116
00:11:28,504 --> 00:11:33,304
♪ For one so small
You seem so strong ♪

117
00:11:33,384 --> 00:11:37,784
♪ My arms will hold you
Keep you safe and warm ♪

118
00:11:37,904 --> 00:11:42,944
♪ This bond between us
Can't be broken ♪

119
00:11:42,984 --> 00:11:47,544
♪ I will be here
Don't you cry ♪

120
00:11:47,664 --> 00:11:51,944
♪ 'Cause you'll
be in my heart ♪

121
00:11:51,984 --> 00:11:56,344
♪ Yes, you'll be in my heart ♪

122
00:11:57,184 --> 00:11:59,384
♪ From this day on ♪

123
00:11:59,464 --> 00:12:03,664
♪ Now and forever more ♪

124
00:12:06,984 --> 00:12:11,304
